# Verification & Quality Audit

## Pre-Commit Checklist

Run these checks before every commit:

### 1. Image Reference Integrity
```bash
# Find all image references and check they resolve
for f in [0-9]*.md; do
  grep -oP '!\[.*?\]\((.*?)\)' "$f" | grep -oP '\((.*?)\)' | tr -d '()' | while read img; do
    [ ! -f "$img" ] && echo "BROKEN: $f → $img"
  done
done
```

### 2. Word Count Audit
```bash
# Flag articles under 500 words
for f in [0-9]*.md; do
  words=$(wc -w < "$f")
  [ "$words" -lt 500 ] && echo "THIN ($words words): $f"
done
```

### 3. Frontmatter Check
```bash
# Verify all articles have title and description
for f in [0-9]*.md; do
  head -5 "$f" | grep -q "^title:" || echo "MISSING TITLE: $f"
  head -5 "$f" | grep -q "^description:" || echo "MISSING DESC: $f"
done
```

### 4. SUMMARY.md Sync
```bash
# Check every article is in SUMMARY.md
for f in [0-9]*.md; do
  grep -q "$f" SUMMARY.md || echo "NOT IN SUMMARY: $f"
done
```

### 5. No Placeholder Text
```bash
grep -rl 'TODO\|TBD\|FIXME\|coming soon\|\[insert' [0-9]*.md
```

## Periodic Full Audit

Run monthly or after major changes:

### Coverage Audit (all features documented?)
```bash
# Check feature coverage across articles
for term in "Asset Sale" "Credit Facilit" "Securitization" "Settlement" \
  "Entra" "Audit" "Adobe Sign" "ABDP" "MFA" "Stablecoin" "Kinexys" \
  "Wormhole" "NFT" "Batch" "Historical Tape" "Rate Limit"; do
  count=$(grep -rli "$term" [0-9]*.md 2>/dev/null | wc -l)
  printf "  %2d articles | %s\n" "$count" "$term"
done
```

### Image Usage Audit
```bash
# Find images in folders that aren't referenced by any article
find images/ -type f | while read img; do
  grep -rl "$(basename "$img")" [0-9]*.md > /dev/null || echo "UNUSED: $img"
done
```

## Production Readiness Criteria

A release is production-ready when:
- [ ] Zero broken image references
- [ ] Zero articles under 300 words
- [ ] All process docs (Type D) have at least 1 screenshot
- [ ] All navigation docs (Type C) have screenshots
- [ ] SUMMARY.md matches all article files exactly
- [ ] ARTICLE_TAXONOMY.md covers all articles
- [ ] No TODO/TBD/placeholder text in any article
- [ ] Commit messages follow the convention
